{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KyMTJzffdRNVWDJFSj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, one thing to settle: the facts don't support promising \"the same cleaner every single time.\" You have a regular cleaner plus a named backup, and last year 7 of 18 cleaners left. These customers saw that turnover firsthand. If even one of them gets a stranger at the door after reading \"every single time,\" you lose them again, and this time they'll feel lied to. I'd suggest promising what you can keep: \"your own regular cleaner, plus a named backup you'll meet in advance, never a stranger.\" That still answers their complaint directly. Are you okay with that wording?\n\nA few questions that would change the email:\n\n1. **What's the $99 offer, exactly?** Is $99 just for the first cleaning, with $165 every other week after that? Is there a contract or minimum number of visits? Does the offer have a deadline?\n2. **What changed so cleaners stay longer?** Have you raised pay, added benefits, or seen fewer people leave this year? That's what makes the regular-cleaner promise believable to someone who watched three different people show up.\n3. **What happens when the regular cleaner can't come?** Does the backup visit the house beforehand, or at least get introduced? If a customer's regular cleaner quits, do you call them and let them choose the replacement?\n4. **Do you want to explain the $25 price gap?** Employees at $21/hour with insurance on every visit is a real reason to pay more than the app services charge. Is there a guarantee too (a free re-clean, a cancel-anytime policy)?\n5. **Who signs it, and how personal can it be?** Does it come from you by name? Will you merge in each customer's first name, or their old cleaner's name?\n6. **Is there anything these customers know or will find out?** For example, did prices go up recently, or did the people who left over price cancel right after an increase?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":775,"cache_read_input_tokens":9533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":775},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4fe0045-faa0-48c7-9baa-92744e4ae3c2","uuid":"aa87e8ec-9ddc-4e58-95df-ef0806eb0929","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:36:49.950Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7KyMKNgpSAiEuMto9He"}
